Third-party datasheets and manufacturer documents
--------------------------------------------------

The directory `src/hardware/m2-board/evidence/datasheets/` contains frozen
local copies of manufacturer datasheets, one mechanical drawing and an
Espressif power-supply design guideline HTML snapshot. These
documents remain the copyrighted property of their respective manufacturers
(or the page copyright holder for the HTML snapshot):

- ESP32-C3-WROOM-02 datasheet — Espressif Systems
- ESP32-C3 schematic-checklist power-supply guideline (HTML snapshot) — Espressif Systems
- SHT3x-DIS datasheet — Sensirion AG
- ME6211 datasheet (V20) — MICRONE (南京微盟) Electronics
- AMS1117-3.3 datasheet — Advanced Monolithic Systems (LCSC-hosted copy)
- KT-0603R approval specification — KENTO
- TYPE-C-31-M-12 mechanical drawing — provenance questionable
  (watermarked HIROSE; recorded in the manifest as
  FROZEN_PROVENANCE_QUESTIONABLE and used as geometry reference only)

They are included solely as reference material and local reproduction for
traceability of hardware-design verification. AEDL makes no claim of
authorship over these documents. Provenance of the frozen files for the
activated components (source URL, sha256, retrieved_at) is recorded in
`src/hardware/m2-board/evidence/datasheet_manifest.json`. The AMS1117-3.3
candidate datasheet is deliberately not listed in that manifest; its
provenance is recorded in `candidate_source_record.json` alongside the
frozen copy, and it is an LCSC-hosted copy rather than a file from the
manufacturer's official website. For any use beyond reference, consult the
original manufacturers.
